osting + 0.184·LSTM_Forecast. Pesos ∝ 1/RMSE_holdout, normalizados.","","","","",""],["Ensemble","Configuração","Média ponderada por 1/RMSE","","","","",""],["Ensemble","Usa exógenas (chuva, letivo)","Sim","","","","",""],["Ensemble","peso_ARIMA",0.1283,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_SARIMAX-12",0.0837,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_SARIMAX-6",0.1014,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_Holt-Winters",0.1018,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_Prophet/UC",0.0723,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_Theta",0.1475,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_GradientBoosting",0.1809,"—","—","—","—",""],["Ensemble","peso_LSTM_Forecast",0.1841,"—","—","—","—",""]]
